                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "<p dir=\"ltr\">This tool contains guidelines for introducing differentiated career paths at a School of a university, from the very first preparatory activities to the post-evaluation actions. This process is visualised into a step-by-step journey with four phases: Plan & Prepare; Develop; Implement & Communicate; Evaluate. </p>"
